OL,3,ABattle of ideas looming in British
OL,4,Apolitics, Badenoch to say
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis week the Tory leader has been
OL,7,Fseeking to re-frame the way the public
OL,8,Fviews her party, which has yet to
OL,9,Frecover in the polls since the last
OL,10,Felection.
OL,12,FThe party has already pledged #10bn for
OL,13,Fa UK air defence system, and proposed
OL,14,Fcuts to the rate of employer National
OL,15,FInsurance contributions for those aged
OL,16,F21 to 24.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
